        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 59 Wilford Court, Bray, Co. Wicklow to the market a super one-bedroom ground floor own door apartment ideally positioned within this mature and well-maintained development. Wilford Court enjoys an exceptionally convenient location close to Bray Town Centre with a wide range of amenities nearby including shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and leisure facilities. Bray Seafront and the picturesque promenade are just a short distance away, offering scenic coastal walks and a vibrant atmosphere year-round. The area is very well serviced by public transport with Bray DART Station and numerous Dublin Bus routes within easy reach, while the N11 and M50 road networks provide excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nBright and well-proportioned internal living accommodation spans to c.66 sqm, and comprises of private own door entrance, open plan living area and fully fitted kitchen, generous double bedroom and main bathroom. The property benefits from a practical layout and excellent natural light throughout.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of No. 59 is the sunny private rear garden laid in lawn, offering a fantastic outdoor space ideal for relaxing and entertaining. The added benefit of own door access further enhances the appeal of this superb property.\r\n\r\nNo. 59 offers an ideal opportunity for first time buyers, and downsizers. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n• c. 66 sqm\r\n• BER C1\r\n• 1 Bed / 1 Bath\r\n• Own door ground floor apartment \r\n• Management fees c. 1,430\r\n• Parking \r\n• Gas heating\r\n• Double glazed windows\r\n• Fully fitted kitchen\r\n• Sunny rear garden in lawn\r\n• A short stroll to the beach \r\n• Bright and airy\r\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout \r\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\r\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance \r\n• No onwards chain\r\n• Highly sought after location \r\n• Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers, and investors\r\n• Viewing highly advised!\r\n\r\nMeasurements;\r\nEntrance Hallway: 1.28m X 5.78m. \r\nLiving Room: 4.98m X 3.96m. \r\nKitchen: 4.98m X 3.12m. \r\nBedroom 1: 3.59m X 4.65m. \r\nBathroom: 3.59m X 1.69m. \r\n\r\nDirections;\r\nEircode: A98 KA75"
      },
